during the past month our community has  seen three murder suicides  one in a summerlin apartment another in  the southwest valley  and one on the las vegas strip bianca  holman shares one southern nevada  resource looking to prevent  these types of situations from this  apartment complex in summerlin where a  married couple was found  to a teen finding his mother and father  shot and killed in the southwest valley  then a wind security officer shot and  killed by another wind employee  who then turned the gun on himself at  the resort's employee parking garage  murder suicides have been in our  headlines recently many people are  feeling the stress of the pandemic  unemployment financial issues depression  and isolation  but advocates from the family justice  center want to help those who are  feeling hopeless and overwhelmed  before the stress boils over and more  lives are lost  the family justice center which has been  open since march of 2018  is actually a best practice model  we provide services to victims of  domestic violence human trafficking  and sexual assault under one roof and  the key to that is it's an array of  services on average a person seeking  help would have to travel more than 26  miles throughout our valley to reach  things like physical emotional or  financial resources  so the family justice center is a  catch-all providing everything one may  need  they serve more than 2 000 victims each  month it's a safe place  but it's also an environment where they  get to make choices  when they come in we don't say well  here's a police officer  and here's an advocate and these are all  the things that you're going to do  we ask them what they want and then we  help them to  navigate that no matter if you're a man  woman and teen in the midst of a crisis  or a concerned friend looking for  guidance greene says their doors  are always open bianca holman 8 news now  to access the city's resources you can  dial 2-1-1 or visit the family justice  center in person  they're located near washington and  mohave road
 

